OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786126701
OL,3,CMass train cancellations in Midlands
OL,4,Cand North West England due to power
OL,5,Cfailure
OL,7,FA power failure has led to multiple
OL,8,Ftrain lines being cancelled across the
OL,9,FMidlands and the North West of
OL,10,FEngland, with several operators urging
OL,11,Fcustomers to avoid travelling.
OL,13,FNational Rail said a power failure at
OL,14,Fa critical communications centre had
OL,15,Fled to the disruption and said trains
OL,16,Fwould be delayed by up to an hour or
OL,17,Fcancelled altogether.
OL,19,FThey said the disruption would last
OL,20,Funtil at least the end of Thursday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/4
