PN,31602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1786126701
OL,3,CMass train cancellations in Midlands
OL,4,Cand North West England due to power
OL,5,Cfailure
OL,7,FSeveral lines, including Avanti West
OL,8,FCoast, East Midlands Railway, and
OL,9,FNorthern, have said many of their
OL,10,Fservices are impacted.
OL,12,FAll Avanti services to Macclesfield
OL,13,Fhave been cancelled, while East
OL,14,FMidlands Railway said all their
OL,15,Fservices between Liverpool and
OL,16,FSheffield had been cancelled.
OL,18,FNorthern and TransPennine Express have
OL,19,Fadvised their customers against
OL,20,Ftravelling.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/4
