OL,3,CMass train cancellations in Midlands
OL,4,Cand North West England due to power
OL,5,Cfailure
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FMany of the trainlines have relaxed
OL,13,Ftheir ticket restrictions in response
OL,14,Fto the disruption, allowing people to
OL,15,Ftake alternate routes at no extra cost.
OL,17,FRefunds are also being offered to
OL,18,Fanyone whose train was cancelled or
OL,19,Fdelayed and customers may also be
OL,20,Fentitled to compensation if they have
OL,21,Fexperienced a delay.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/4
